{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/241237-the-onyx-path-movie","id":241237,"title":"The Onyx Path Movie!","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-08-26T05:45:16-07:00","id":241237,"title":"The Onyx Path Movie!","content":"OK so here we go I want to see by votes out of all the Onyx Path products what would you like to see as the following<ol class=\"decimal\"><li>Movie</li> <li>TV Show</li> <li>Anime</li> </ol>This is just a fan discussion dream not somthing that is going to really happen ...unless there there is a big fuss and demand... nah that could never start a new Kickstarter...or could it?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Like the Sun I am relentless even in death...","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3293-rahod","name":"Rahod","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-26T06:19:12-07:00","id":241276,"title":"","content":"Well, while movies are well know for destroying their source instead of adapting it, a TV show could be amazing. Just let HBO take care of it like they've done with Game of Thrones and we would be fine. <br /> <br /> I dream about a serie focused on Hunters, with the &quot;monster of the week&quot; based on all the core books, slowly building up the tension for a spin off entirely focused on a particular creature, whichever they feel will be the most popular.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>English is not my native language, sorry guys.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/607-amadeu","name":"Amadeu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"46"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-26T06:22:34-07:00","id":241282,"title":"","content":"Movie: <b>Scion,</b> action blockbuster.<br /> TV Show: <b>World of Darkness</b> mortals line, general small town creeping esoterica with a meta-arc touching on the God-Machine mythos.<br /> Anime: <b>Werewolf: The Apocalypse,</b> all-ages episodic action cartoon with a surprisingly downbeat series finale.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-26T06:43:02-07:00","id":241295,"title":"","content":"Well, White Wolf did have the TV show, &quot;<a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kindred:_The_Embraced\" target=\"_blank\">Kindred; the Embraced</a>,&quot; which was Vampire the Masquerade, and it wasn't too bad. (The show's lead Mark Frankel was killed in an accident and that nailed the coffin on resurrecting the show.)<br /> <br /> As for Hunters, I tend to look at Buffy the Vampire Slayer (did more than slay vamps) and the old 70s show &quot;Kolchak, the Night Stalker.&quot;<br /> <br /> And Scion has the wretched &quot;Percy Jackson&quot; as an example of what NOT to do.<br /> <br /> I don't think any WoD movie should be rated &quot;PG.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Mankind was once an endangered species. It will likely be so again. And mankind will only have itself to blame.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/144-shadowflame","name":"Shadowflame","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar144_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1223"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-26T11:14:12-07:00","id":241501,"title":"","content":"Why limit it?<br /> <br /> I think a World of Darkness series could do some really cool things as a multi-media affair. So mix it up!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-26T12:11:41-07:00","id":241582,"title":"","content":"This thread has me replacing all the characters in Game of Thrones with vampires in my head (Jaime and Cersei in a Hungarian marriage!). And Geist would make a wicked anime.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Ortam + Malkavia makes a Requiem fun.<br /> <span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Posts in this colour are Persuasion.</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#800080\">Posts in this colour are Seduction.</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#00FF00\">Posts in this colour are Intimidation.</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/57-solomon-birch","name":"solomon birch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar57_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"289"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-26T14:08:26-07:00","id":241702,"title":"","content":"I want a Changeling The Lost TV Show. Seriously, it could be so good.<br /> Scion...would work well as a anime. As a film, it would be too rushed. And a TV serie would be way too cheap.<br /> Exalted could only work in anime.<br /> Werewolf could make it into a movie. It could be cheesy, but it has a good potential.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;And for my next trick&quot; I said, &quot;anvils!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2016-evilmarmelade","name":"Evilmarmelade","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2016_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"632"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-26T15:47:19-07:00","id":241772,"title":"","content":"I would give my right arm for a <i>good</i> Requiem or Masquerade show. I never saw Kindred: the Embraced, so I won't discount the possibility that it's exactly what I want in a vampire show. But I am very picky about my vampire fiction.<br /> <br /> As for a movie? Promethian. 'Nuff said.<br /> <br /> Animated series (I hesitate to say anime, because I doubt it would be made in Japan), I could live with my coveted vampire show being animated. Again, as long as it's well done. Exalted or Scion could be cool, but I am not as big on them. You could do cool stuff with Changeling in an animated format.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-26T16:15:28-07:00","id":241791,"title":"","content":"&gt;Anime: Werewolf: The Apocalypse, all-ages episodic action cartoon with a surprisingly downbeat series finale.<br /> <br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/j4OeJb8.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cI am absolute, I am perfect, I am supreme. I shall be eternal. My tragedy, is that there is no other fate for me. My powerlessness was that I couldn\u2019t subjugate my journey to the gods, while dreaming of rebirth at the end of distant time, like other pharaohs.\u201d Ramesses II, Fate/Prototype: Argent Fragments.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2918-kat","name":"Kat","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2918_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1762"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-26T17:04:04-07:00","id":241818,"title":"","content":"The minute anything goes anime, I tune it out and shut it off.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Mankind was once an endangered species. It will likely be so again. And mankind will only have itself to blame.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/144-shadowflame","name":"Shadowflame","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar144_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1223"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-26T18:48:10-07:00","id":241899,"title":"","content":"I don't want to derail the thread, but I'm going to do that thing.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shadowflame</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/241237-the-onyx-path-movie?p=241818#post241818\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The minute anything goes anime, I tune it out and shut it off.</div> </div> </div> </div>This seems odd to me... It's just an art style. Granted, it's often pretty stylized, a lot of animes do involve certain common tropes that are not to everyone's taste. But that's cultural influence, not the art style itself. It's one thing to not watch anime because you know odds are pretty good it's not going to be your kind of thing, but isn't it a bit extreme to say if someone made an animated series of a thing you like you'd refuse to watch it because of the style it was animated in?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-26T22:09:15-07:00","id":241978,"title":"","content":"I would love a tv series set in the nWoD universe where every season the focus changes on another splat and we have a totally new story. Like American Horror Story does it.<br /> <br /> An Exalted anime would be awesome.<br /> <br /> As for a movie, I am not sure I want one. Due to limited screen time too many things would have to be left out for my taste.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3669-blackheartz","name":"blackheartz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3669_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"174"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-26T22:10:43-07:00","id":241979,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/241237-the-onyx-path-movie?p=241772#post241772\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">As for a movie? Promethian. 'Nuff said.</div> </div> </div> </div> THe amazing thing about it is that Promethean's fiction would be <i>so easy</i> to adapt into film, I think. <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-26T22:36:50-07:00","id":242024,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/241237-the-onyx-path-movie?p=241979#post241979\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> THe amazing thing about it is that Promethean's fiction would be <i>so easy</i> to adapt into film, I think.</div> </div> </div> </div>Agreed, that's why it's my movie pick. Promethian tells a really cool story, but it is a much more specific story than a lot of the other lines. Which is exactly why it would be the line best suited to a movie adaptation.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-26T22:47:13-07:00","id":242027,"title":"","content":"The end of the first part would be so chilling...<br /> <br /> I think that honestly might be my favorite WoD fiction, period, if I'm honest. It's genuinely disturbing and has a great sense of building tension.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-27T03:23:02-07:00","id":242134,"title":"","content":"The World of Darkness Anthology Series. As much as I hate it, the decision of CWOD or NWOD would have to be made in advance. The public wouldn't be able to handle two variations of the same splat type under one banner.<br /> <br /> First season is a collection of 2 hour movies, 3 apiece from each different game line. 3 vampire movies with the same recurring main character, 3 werewolf movies with the same recurring pack, etc. Which ever group gets the best ratings gets a whole season devoted to them (see American Horror Story). Any group with insufficient ratings can have recurring roles in the other series, but doesn't get their own until the ratings and general popularity can support it. If it looks like it can be sustained, each line can come out as a stand alone series, (i.e., the vampire stories stop being billed as World of Darkness, but instead are now the new series, Vampire the XXX).<br /> <br /> K, now somebody get to work on this over at Onyx Path. True Blood is ending. Supernatural is probably on it's last season. There's room for a new horror show.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>- If you must be ridiculous, I must ridicule you.<br /> - Those that can give up essential liberties in exchange for temporary safety deserve neither liberty nor safety. -- Benjamin Franklin</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/375-papa-bear","name":"Papa Bear","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar375_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1920"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-27T05:26:55-07:00","id":242174,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/241237-the-onyx-path-movie?p=241899#post241899\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">This seems odd to me... It's just an art style.</div> </div> </div> </div>It seems odd to me that it ever gained any traction in American consciousness.<br /> But it's an acquired taste. Fortunately as movies go it never gained any serious traction beyond the small niche it has in American culture which is where the money is. (and I'm sure that also seems odd to you)<br /> And speaking of movies, I recall hearing Kevin Smith lamenting that to make a big budget movie today takes serious advertising revenue that typically adds $10-20 million to the budget if you want to make a big theater splash. So, if there's a movie in the making it needs a big producer/s to finance it. And that means it needs a wide appeal.<br /> <br /> But that's part of the mechanics and probably not for the tone in this thread. But I can definitely see Mage and Scion as big productions. Maybe Werewolf as well. I think the public is played out on vampires. (The biggest success was sparkly)<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Mankind was once an endangered species. It will likely be so again. And mankind will only have itself to blame.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/144-shadowflame","name":"Shadowflame","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar144_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1223"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-27T05:50:23-07:00","id":242182,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\">If you do cWoD you would have to a movie about one character from each main book and then tie them all together into the apocalypse as a final movie leaving the ending as wide open as possible.<br /> <br /> Mage -- a orphan who is being chased by the technocracy and trying to be recruited by the traditions and has help from a marauders who wants to pull him into his own world and a nephandi who has his own ideas for his dark masters.<br /> <br /> Werewolf -- last of his kind born a pure white howler who is just trying to make sense of his own world living in a troubled urban city working at a pentex factory to make ends meet. Umbral Spirits keep trying to guide him but he thinks someone is trying to drug him until a pack attempts to take out the factory only to discover his existence in combat.<br /> <br /> Vampire -- Now for a real twist a Tzimisce and Giovanni who are trying to convert to the Camarilla and are being attacked for their abandonment to their people. they with the help of a Setite find a way to convince the Camarilla they are really wanting to change sides. If the dirty snake didn't double cross them and sell them out to some Hunters.<br /> <br /> ok so if you open up about with &quot;what about changeling the dreaming&quot; well no....it would be just another &quot;<span style=\"color:#545454\">The Secret Life of Walter Mitty&quot;\\</span><br /> <span style=\"color:#545454\">and if you ask about wraith the oblivion well we can slide them between all the stories as someone who keeps telling people to kill them self before they bring the apocalypse<br /> <br /> Final movie Demon the fallen show up and bring all the characters together to die in the Apocalypse </span></span></span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Like the Sun I am relentless even in death...","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3293-rahod","name":"Rahod","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-27T06:02:14-07:00","id":242194,"title":"","content":"I was thinking about it yesterday:<br /> <br /> A tv show,<br /> <b>1st season</b>: 3 episodes for every main supernatural race. 3 for requiem, 3 for forsaken, 3 for awakening<br /> Same ambientation (neutral, not boston, not denver, not new orleans).<br /> <br /> If the shows take great success, let's go with one season for every game. (Yes, I'm dreaming I know..)<br /> <br /> Or, tv show for each game.<br /> Sons of Anarchy reminds me a lot of WtF<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Werewolf the Apocalypse is perfect for an anime I think<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#800000\">-'' </span>We are the unsullied.<br /> We are the inheritors.<br /> We are the Pure <span style=\"color:#800000\">''-</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3773-helur","name":"Helur","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3773_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"352"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-27T06:19:37-07:00","id":242205,"title":"","content":"Werewolf anime? o hell no...That's just another way of going &quot;furries.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Mankind was once an endangered species. It will likely be so again. And mankind will only have itself to blame.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/144-shadowflame","name":"Shadowflame","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar144_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1223"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-27T06:23:31-07:00","id":242207,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shadowflame</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/241237-the-onyx-path-movie?p=242205#post242205\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Werewolf anime? o hell no...That's just another way of going &quot;furries.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>it depends I guess.<br /> I mean something like an adult-horror animated series, not exactly a japanese anime","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#800000\">-'' </span>We are the unsullied.<br /> We are the inheritors.<br /> We are the Pure <span style=\"color:#800000\">''-</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3773-helur","name":"Helur","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3773_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"352"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-27T10:06:23-07:00","id":242310,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shadowflame</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/241237-the-onyx-path-movie?p=242205#post242205\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Werewolf anime? o hell no...That's just another way of going &quot;furries.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>I was thinking more along the lines of the cartoon version of Toxic Avenger.<br /> <br /> I sound like I'm joking but I'm completely serious. Cartoons can be made suitable for kids without sacrificing a message, and Werewolf: the Apocalypse doesn't need intestines being ripped out on-screen in order to communicate an atmosphere of savage outrage and desperate battle. Apocalypse marries its message with a sense of humor that's sometimes sardonic and sometimes goofy, which would be perfect to lighten the tone. It'd be toyetic, it can reel kids in with the violent action and then hook them with character drama and a platform to try to approach the battle for Earth in a more nuanced and personal way than the Captain Planet cartoon, but still be close enough to the mark to draw in the nostalgia market of older geeks who like cartoons.<br /> <br /> The real reason this won't happen is money, an obscure intellectual property license, and risk-aversion among contemporary animation studios, Eastern or Western.<br /> <br /> But I'd watch the hell out of it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-27T10:29:31-07:00","id":242319,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shadowflame</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/241237-the-onyx-path-movie?p=242174#post242174\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It seems odd to me that it ever gained any traction in American consciousness.<br /> But it's an acquired taste. Fortunately as movies go it never gained any serious traction beyond the small niche it has in American culture which is where the money is. (and I'm sure that also seems odd to you)</div> </div> </div> </div>No, not really. You said it, it's definitely an acquired taste, and it makes perfect sense that it would find success within a niche market and not so much with a wider audience. It's success in America can probably be attributed to our tendency to exoticize just about everything that comes from Asia. The only thing I find odd is when people decide &quot;this thing I would otherwise like is automatically bad because of the way it's animated&quot;. It's also odd to me that some people feel that way about animation in general.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-27T10:59:47-07:00","id":242332,"title":"","content":"Wraith the Oblivion. <br /> <br /> TV series or animated show. The MC would be an experienced Doom Slayer/Spectre hunter/detective. Episodes would follow him as he hunts down spectres, travels into the Labyrinth, or deals with the politics of Stygia.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-27T11:07:00-07:00","id":242337,"title":"","content":"*shrugs* <br /> Movies, TV...it's not about just telling a story, it's how it's visually presented. (of course looking at Michael Bay that likely doesn't speak well of American tastes)<br /> Anime movies don't sell for theater presentation because they don't have the wide appeal that Disney/Pixar animation does.<br /> But anime DVDs sell by the truckloads here. And it's a billion dollar business worldwide.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Mankind was once an endangered species. It will likely be so again. And mankind will only have itself to blame.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/144-shadowflame","name":"Shadowflame","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar144_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1223"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-08-27T11:20:08-07:00","id":242343,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <